142990/f150ec096a3b677e6e637570824e41e9756aa950/ss_f150ec096a3b677e6e637570824e41e9756aa950.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773147444","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4142990/f150ec096a3b677e6e637570824e41e9756aa950/ss_f150ec096a3b677e6e637570824e41e9756aa950.600x338.jpg?t=1773147444"}],"short_description":"Remember those epic LAN afternoons with your dad or friends? Atomic Blastman brings them back. Pick a color, suit up, and blast your way through huge arenas. Power-ups, sudden death, chaos, and laughs guaranteed. Just... please... don\u2019t blow yourself up! Chaos and madness, guaranteed.","steam_appid":4142990,"support_info":{"email":"indiependentgs@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":"https://indiependentgamesstudio.com/html/description/atomicBlastman"}